silm:instances_papers_05_granite_substrate_chapters_06_yoneda_closure_sections_02_closure_criterion_concrete_anchor#closurecriterionsymbol silm:hasLongDescription "The ClosureCriterionSymbol is The Yoneda closure criterion for the Granite encyclopedia entry: the olog is closed under Mittens when Hom(-,Mittens) is fully-faithful in G_Granite, i.e., every object related to Mittens through a typed leg is explicitly present in the olog and every typed morphism between related objects is accounted for." .
